    "message": "Construct actual graph outgoing-cost lists and same-run path accumulation\n\nPreserve the full 135-module runtime closure and every existing gate. Add five source-reviewed, strictly compiled, audited and kernel-replayed instruction modules; sixteen actual lower-machine fixtures. The graph adapter now constructs its outgoing cost list from retained path indices rather than assuming that cost list. Fresh 140-module CI remains required. Path discovery, costed candidate collection/selector construction, complete solver substitution and fast physical runtime remain open.",
